          <dd class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-brand-body">{body}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
      Microsoft's 2011 certificates start expiring in June 2026: PCs need the 2023 CAs to keep receiving db and dbx updates. Source:{" "}
      <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/manufacture/desktop/windows-secure-boot-key-creation-and-management-guidance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={link}>Secure Boot key guidance</a>.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Public Secure Boot breaks</h3>
